; The six sockets. Unturned: a socket's +Z is the direction a plug arrives from,
; and on this face that is the box's own +Z. At z = 0.044, 1.5 mm out from the
; 42.5 mm face, so the recess's mouth stands half a millimetre proud of the shell
; instead of fighting it for the same plane. Their "S400 i.LINK" plates are off:
; six of them edge to edge is clutter, and the numbers above say the rest.
